			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>UUID</key>
				<string>6570E74B-CC7B-418F-9E2D-FF4DDF43E074</string>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Legal Edge steps pilot. Read-only Health access. Recent step samples are sent over HTTPS to your private account. The server uses one exact source, excludes today, rejects overlapping readings and reports a real saved-day receipt. Keep your key private. Test one upload against Health before scheduling. iOS may block Health reads while locked.</string>
